  "title": "United Bank Named Best Bank in South Carolina by Forbes for Second Consecutive Year",
  "summary": "Charleston, S.C. – United Bank has once again earned the position of the No. 1 bank in South Carolina on Forbes’ list of Best-in-State Banks for 2024. Forbes presented its annual ranking of banks in each state according to an independent survey of U.S. consumers and a sentiment analysis of publicly available reviews and ratings, which resulted in a top spot for United.",
